00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.060
<b>The Advent of Dianna</b>

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.940
<i>The road ahead is pretty rough! Watch yourselves!</i>

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.150
You guys can keep up, right?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.950
The only way we'll be able to beat their mechanical dolls is with numbers!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.130
So they land on other peoples property and build a fence there.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.420
Those guys are pretty bold...

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.430
Where's Miashei and Sochie's plane?!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.100
The mission's about to start!

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.400
<i>Laura, your mechanical doll...</i>

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.860
<i>...is what the militia will rely on.</i>

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.860
<i>If we appear less powerful than the enemy, they won't view us as their equal.</i>

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.950
In order to negotiate, we need power.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.240
What is it?

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.500
We're altering our course.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.620
We'll be arriving in Vicinity a bit behind schedule.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.830
We're late?

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.040
<i>It seems a battle is going on below us.</i>

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.960
Can you see it, Milady?

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.550
Where is it?

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.930
<i>- It's Miashei and Sochie!</i>
- Huh?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.930
You see Lady Sochie?!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.640
That's got to be Sochie!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.230
It is the Hipheavy...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.860
Those are militia troops.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.940
Can you see them?

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.160
Do they plan to assault the Moonrace forces' encampment we saw?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.160
<i>Who's flying it over here? Miashei?</i>

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:06.160
<i>Sochie's flying it! But why?</i>

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.620
Sochie's flying one of those, isn't she?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.120
<i>Yeah, but why?</i>

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.960
Are we back in Vicinity?

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.130
Mother...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.340
<i>Miashei! Milady Sochie!</i>

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.420
It's useless to try to fight them in that plane!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.550
Loran, that's dangerous! What the heck are you doing?!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.720
They're trying to use this airship for cover.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.230
For cover?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.940
So they won't be picked up on radar. Milady, do you want me to find out what the girls are planning?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.860
<i>Miss!</i>

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.150
Please let me on your plane!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.530
Oh, is Sochie back?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:48.160
Mother, you really should stay seated for the time being.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.330
Why?

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.460
Because we're still airborne.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.460
But I need to prepare our servant's summer outfits!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.460
Milady, please take good care of the Mistress.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.550
<i>Loran, what are you doing?</i>

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.420
Excuse me! I'd like to be let out. Open the door!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.130
You wanna get out?! But we're airborne!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.340
I'm not going to kill myself.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.640
I'm a militia airplane mechanic!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.850
<i>You</i> are?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.430
I'm not lying! My plane is here to pick me up.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.150
Oh, God. The kid's really gonna jump on the plane!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.490
Sochie, slow us down and try to get as close as you can!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.360
As close as I can?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.030
As slow and as close as possible...

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.660
<i>Don't look down!</i>

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.660
I can't reach it!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.120
Can you see him?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.040
<i>You're too far ahead! Go back!</i>

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.130
Ah, crap! It's rotating too slow now!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.800
Now you've slowed us down too much!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.430
Okay!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.760
If the propeller stopped entirely, how'd you intend to restart it?!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.930
That's some pretty incredible maneuverability!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.350
Of course it is! It's my fighter plane down there!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.940
I can't see below my feet...

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.650
Here they are.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.150
Like I said--

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.530
Right, I understand.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.660
Bring us in a little higher!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.160
A little closer!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.120
Please come in a bit closer, Lady Sochie!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.420
Just a little more!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:26.930
He jumped!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.140
Loran!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.560
What the hell are you doing?

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.640
You always do these kinds of things.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.650
Just try to imagine the pain I'm in right now!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.860
Sorry about that. I was actually on my way back to your house.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.740
What about my sister and mother?

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.150
They're on the airship.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.860
What are you trying to do here?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.740
Miss Miashei, has your father given you permission to do this?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.160
Doesn't matter.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.450
But what can you hope to do with a plane like this?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.250
<i>So you're alright with Earth getting conquered?</i>

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.960
The Moonrace haven't even thought of doing something like that.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.840
They just want a place to live.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.460
<i>And how do you know that?</i>

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.550
I heard about it when they captured me.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:10.340
If the Moonrace hadn't come to Earth, my dad wouldn't have died!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.760
<i>That's true, but...</i>

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:15.640
They're planning to use their mechanical dolls to kill us all!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.150
Milady, please don't let the plane fly at this angle!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.360
Well your butt's blocking my view! Move it!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.230
Sochie...

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:30.030
Oh my, are they holding some kind of festival!?

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.450
Sergeant Yanni and the others have started!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.660
Sochie, it's time to start the operation!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.830
Roger!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.830
What operation?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.830
You don't know? We're gonna capture one of their mechanical dolls!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.130
But there's no way you can pull that off!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.250
Let's go.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.260
Don't fall behind the fighter squadron!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.930
Our objective is to eliminate those mechanical dolls!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.350
It looks like the girls' plane is here.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.560
Is that their aim?

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.950
Get the hell outta here, space aliens!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.750
<i>Load their people onto the trucks!</i>

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.960
Capture their possessions! Don't let anyone escape!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.460
There are children here!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.550
Do you want to die?!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.340
Take anything we can't use for our scientists to research!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.130
Leave no stone unturned!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:37.560
Miashei! What are you trying to do?!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.730
If we let them destroy all the mechanical dolls, we'll never be able to understand their technology!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:41.940
I want one!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.150
Are you serious?!

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.230
I'll show you what we can do!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:50.860
What the--?!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.160
What kind of monster is she!?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.540
Is this what all Terrans are like?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.750
Damn you! Damn you!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.720
<i>How dare the militia attack our returning citizens!</i>

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.640
<i>Why can't I crush these pitiful subhumans?!</i>

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.810
I'm gonna take revenge for Captain Aji!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:31.030
Are they trying to capture a civilian Mobil Rib?

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.450
WaD squadron, take care of the militia.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.450
I'm gonna--

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.740
- It's a WaDom!
- What?!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.450
It's a h-huge mechanical doll!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.250
Stop this! Turn back! You're gonna die--

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.540
I can't attack them if you do that!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.340
Are you on the Moon's side now?!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.920
If she gets serious, we'll get killed in no time!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.340
W-We're falling!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.430
Damn piece of crap!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.440
You barbarians aren't worthy of being killed by me!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.440
And yet you still want to go to war with us?!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.240
It's sickening to think we have to fight against primitives like you.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.160
Let me go!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.540
Crushing you would only make my WaDom dirty.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.460
Guess I'll take you hostage.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:28.540
Miashei!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.960
Milady, please take me back to Vicinity.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.130
So we're just gonna abandon her!?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.130
That's not what I mean!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.430
We need the White Doll, right? I'll use it to save Miashei.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.340
Loran... you're right.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.940
We've received a report that several civilians have been killed, sir.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.860
So you're saying the militia attacked unarmed citizens?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:52.730
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.240
Yes. The Air Force has been deployed.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:58.820
I told Colonel Michael to give do nothing more than threaten them.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.450
Go check on them again.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.660
Sir.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:09.250
I hereby ask you to disregard any of the radio communications we had with Dianna Counter over the past two years.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:14.630
So you refuse to acknowledge the fact that there is a race of humans, the Moonrace, living on the moon?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:19.430
What I am trying to say is that we no longer possess any such knowledge of the Moonrace or your technology.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.760
So you barbarians wish to face us with barbaric methods?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:26.640
Unfortunately, I'm not quite so sure that's how I would word it.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:33.230
But I thought I told you to water the flowers in his room.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.860
But Mother...

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.860
Sam! Jessica!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.740
You've done enough today.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.240
I'm so glad you're back.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.950
Take care of her, Jessica.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.740
C-Come now, Madam.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:48.500
Oh, it's Jessica! I'm so terribly sorry that this had to happen to your house.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.130
Wait, so you still haven't found any weapons the White Doll can use?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.140
We just found some for the other mechanical dolls.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.430
Their hand sizes are different.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.140
Still, I think some of the Mustache's weapons might be hidden somewhere near here.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.150
The ball shaped units are being cleaned now, and the militia soldiers

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.520
agreed to help dig up more machines.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.860
<i>I'm sure we'll find some more.</i>

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.230
You're probably right.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.950
We still have to do some maintenance on the mechanical dolls we found.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.660
It doesn't look nearly as big lying down.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.540
Loran, where are you going?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.450
Miashei's been captured.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.750
I'm gonna use this to rescue her.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.750
- That came from the Mustache?
- Yeah.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:37.130
I guess there are weapons mounted in its chest or something.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.260
What'd you press?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.760
I'm not really sure.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.630
Is that the Mustache's manual book?

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.640
Look! It's not a book at all!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:47.640
There are records of electronic books like that in the Dark History.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.220
You really think so?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.230
You should read it as soon as you can!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:55.150
I can't just read the whole thing in such a short time!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.620
Oh, Sam. Good work.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.710
Kihel, let's decorate the west side of the living room.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.010
The window glass and frame need to be changed.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.130
Okay.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.300
Your father will be upset if we don't do a good job.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.510
Yeah.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:40.900
That's the mustached White Doll.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.120
Sochie really did join the army.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.710
Well, the hatch's armor isn't in the best of shape.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.120
Then it'll be your job to fix it.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.420
Let's take it back to the base.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.840
<i>Cut the crap!</i>

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.210
<i>By our standards, you're no soldier.</i>

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.630
<i>But you're still part of your own army.</i>

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.800
<i>You can't do such things without their permission!</i>

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.300
Guin put you up to this, didn't he!?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.810
Shut up already!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.930
I came here by my own will to get rid of you all!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:18.230
But now you're tying me up and calling <i>me</i> the invader!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:21.820
There's no reason a member of the Air Force would just act out on their own!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.030
Well if you don't like it,

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.320
then put me in front of that firing squad!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.740
You barbarian!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:30.330
You suggest I should execute a child like you!?

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.700
I'm not going to let you influence me.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.830
You're only a wild animal, so I've tied you up instead.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.920
- Make sure she stays put.
<i>-Sir!</i>

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.420
- Got it?
-Sir!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.920
I'm here to take back the hostage!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.010
Who's that?!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.220
You've become so cruel that now you're threatening us by taking hostages?!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.930
That's no way to fight a war!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.930
That mustached mobile suit is back!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.930
Why didn't you sound the alarm?!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.730
<i>I'm here to take back the hostage!</i>

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.020
Don't deploy the WaDs! Have them protect our encampment!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.320
- The savage has come out to meet us. He's unarmed.
- Sir!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.030
Ensign Poe, do you read?

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.320
Yes, Lieutenant.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:12.030
The enemy is unarmed. Don't worry about getting hit. Just capture him!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:12.530
<i>Sir!</i>

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.330
Hold it!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.330
Did you see that, Poe?! The hostage has escaped!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.000
We can use her!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.630
Dammit! If you don't stop, I'll shoot!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.130
Stop!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.800
<i>It's barbaric to treat your hostages so poorly!</i>

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:37.100
A Terran like you is the last one I want to hear that from,

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.520
pilot of the mustached mobile suit!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.810
Pilot?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.030
Let my Miashei go!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.610
We're goin' in, Miss Sochie!

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.820
Let me go, you coward!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.620
So you resort to using a weak little girl like me as a shield?!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.330
You're a weak little girl?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.960
If you want to get down, lose ten pounds.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.000
Hey, Mustache's pilot! Hand over your mobile suit!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.130
<i>Is that really the way you do things?</i>

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.210
<i>That can't really be a girl, can it?</i>

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.420
Ask those militia soldiers to back off!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:10.930
<i>That's the deal!</i>

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:16.100
I always thought of Dianna Counter as a respectable army,

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.100
<i>but you're the shame of the Moonrace!</i>

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.730
How dare you!

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.520
<i>- Don't worry about me!
- Don't die, Miashei!</i>

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.520
You little shit!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.920
Hold your fire, Ensign Poe!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.720
<i>Why should I?!</i>

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.010
This is our chance to crush that mobile suit!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.010
You need to learn when to quit!

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:58.520
We've got data on it now.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.230
You'd just embarrass yourself trying to chase it.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.820
<i>- I'm going to remove the hand.
- Go ahead.</i>

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.200
Sochie! Papa!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.910
Miashei! Way to go! You did it!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.330
Loran, it seems like you've got the hang of it now!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.620
I still haven't learned how to fully drive it yet...

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:29.340
Weren't you afraid I might get crushed when you cut off the arm?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.300
I figured the fingers would be locked in place, so not really, no.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.510
The fingers were locked in place?

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.930
It can function like that?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.600
- Amazing machine, isn't it?
- Yeah.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:51.740
We have confirmation. The militia attempted to steal a civilian Mobil Rib.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:57.410
In addition, it seems the mustached mobile suit attacked the camp where we protect our civilians.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.410
That phone call was from the other squadron,

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.540
but they mentioned a similar sounding report.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.500
Looks like your communication network has some issues.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.630
It's fine the way it is.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.000
Excuse me.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.630
I'm no peacemaker.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.220
I still wish to continue the negotiations.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.720
If Captain Aji were still with us, he would have said the same thing.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.010
Can't that call be transferred here?

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.810
I take private calls in here.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.230
It's from my fiancé.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:33.820
Well they're the instigators, seeing as they took a hostage and all.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.530
<i>Damn right.</i>

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:41.530
<i>Which is why we're currently making preparations to fight back. Shall we show them our true strength?</i>

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.410
Have those ball-shaped mechanical dolls started moving yet?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:48.210
<i>The mustached mechanical doll has helped teach us what we need.</i>

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.420
<i>Excellent.</i>

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.710
<i>- Then let's get to it.
- Sir!</i>

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.720
<i>I hear Dianna Soriel will be arriving at Nocis Airport shortly.</i>

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>We have to be ready to show her Laura's mechanical doll.</i>

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.610
Are those the mechanical dolls you found in the mine?

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.900
They're called Kapools.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.910
The militia's own mechanical squadron will finally be ready for the attack, My Lady.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.540
So the rumors are true.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.210
<i>Hey, sis!</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.340
Sochie! Come down from there! Stop this!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.420
Too bad! I'm its driver now.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.010
The pilot's a girl!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.930
Is that your little sister? She's pretty cool!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.550
Yeah...

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.640
<i>You can't give it just any kind of fuel!</i>

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.310
<i>The fuel from the Dark History is different from ours.</i>

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:46.930
Loran!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.810
Colonel Michael, this is too reckless!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.520
<i>Quiet down!</i>

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.110
Thank you.

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:59.110
<i>This is an order from Guin Rhineford himself!</i>

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.820
An order from Lord Guin?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.030
Anyway, it's pretty incredible, isn't it?

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.830
Will you be driving one of those too, Miss Miashei?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.330
That thing's not like an airplane. I can't drive it.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.000
I'm here to take you home. Let's go, Sochie.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.840
No way! We're about to set out for an attack!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.210
Aren't you worried about Mother?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:21.720
Well you seem pretty happy, so I'm sure Mom will be fine too.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.800
Well...

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.930
<i>I need to do something to protect Mom,</i>

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.430
<i>so I'm gonna fight in this Kapool!</i>

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.600
Sochie...!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.440
As long as we can capture the enemy leader,

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.520
it doesn't matter how powerful their weapons are.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.530
But keep in mind that if she dies,

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.740
we'll have screwed up big time.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.320
Why don't we just wait and see what happens when Her Majesty Dianna gets here?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.530
What's with the "Her Majesty"?

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.030
S-Sorry.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.910
Wars can only lead to the deaths of innocent people.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:52.710
This is no war. We only want to kidnap Dianna.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.920
Laura's mechanical doll will escort Lord Guin.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.840
Is this clear?

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:58.630
...Yes, sir.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.520
- Those really are something.
- Sir.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.730
Laura's on the way.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.400
We won't appear to be the weaker force after all.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.240
It seems he's quite important.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.330
He's come here with only his bare hands. Who does he think he is?

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.000
Here it comes!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.800
It's the <i>Soleil</i>!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.720
Her Majesty Dianna Soriel really is here!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.610
Her Majesty Dianna must be on the bridge.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.510
Has Colonel Michael arrived at Bostonia Castle?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.510
Yes.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.130
Bostonia Castle...

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.010
- Thank you.
- Sir.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.930
Behind the tower! Something's moving!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.730
If I use the highest magnification...

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.320
Queen Dianna!

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.320
It really is her!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.320
She's in there!

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.510
I am Dianna Soriel.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:10.720
You must be Lord Guin Sard Rhineford.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.220
Y-Yes, M'am.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:15.310
Y-Your Excellency Dianna Soriel...

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:16.730
You may rise.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:17.600
<i>Ma'am.</i>

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.560
Those who arrived before me, I thank you for a job well done!

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:43.730
<i>Those whom lack power attempted to capture Queen Dianna.</i>

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:47.440
<i>Thanks to this, I got a chance to see Her Majesty Dianna up close.</i>

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.820
<i>I was so happy.</i>

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:54.030
<i>But because of Keith and Fran, and because of the mysterious container of supplies I found in Vicinity,</i>

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.830
<i>...the situation will likely only get worse.</i>

00:23:58.700 --> 00:24:00.710
<i>Next time, on </i>Turn-A Gundam,

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.710
<i>The Forgotten Past</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:05.040
"The wind shows its colors."

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>The Forgotten Past</b>
